                        "entry_id": "7eb1ea1b-298d-346c-82ca-9555b2eaaea4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A (usually white) woman held in contempt by the speaker because she is basic or unaware of, or is taking advantage of, her social privilege (white privilege)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "colloquial",
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7ec0a63-f220-451b-a60a-957c884bb077",
                                "sense_id": "740da6a4-1657-3991-a4ce-56c522dfd1a5",
                                "text": "We were smoking weed in the park, but then some Becky called the cops on us."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3572d58-358d-4ffd-8cbf-b780613720a8",
                                "sense_id": "740da6a4-1657-3991-a4ce-56c522dfd1a5",
                                "text": "He only want me when I'm not there\nHe better call Becky with the good hair"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cc93132-6ab0-4378-9416-0c9aa4044fda",
                                "sense_id": "740da6a4-1657-3991-a4ce-56c522dfd1a5",
                                "text": "Last year, native Hawaiian activists grew angry after news that Aloha Poke’s attorneys were sending cease and desist letters to poke shop owners who used the word “aloha” in their restaurants’s names. Native Hawaiians felt the Chicago company was trying to regulate their language and culture. Boycotters have taken to calling Aloha Poke food “Becky Bowls.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "36d981cb-389d-3d0e-a593-55e5910a5564",
                        "entry_id": "7eb1ea1b-298d-346c-82ca-9555b2eaaea4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An average-looking woman."
